{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "683f49ceb2f777bf1869fd7357c00e5188f08bea94108537e40a8a9f03282b11", "ja": "（桃子のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影に同行している。\n挑戦的な衣装だし、しっかり目を光らせておかないと）", "zh": "（我陪桃子参加了写真企划的角色扮演拍摄。服装很大胆，可得好好盯着才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7f54b419d2fcfb8c23da99187a15730c5a4fef7d6a8e798a817dcb740c73ebd", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん。じっと桃子のこと見てるけど、何？\nもしかして、こういう衣装が好きなの？", "zh": "……哥哥。你一直盯着桃子看，怎么了？\n难道说，你喜欢这种服装？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4370fc009702b62f686c9d105308affe3ea6a7d49b0760469be2b788af38b0a8", "ja": "ち、違うぞ！　桃子のプロデューサーとして\n見守っているだけで……。", "zh": "不、不是！作为桃子的制作人，我只是在一旁看着她而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "739c7e9416f07668bdd191d8f08c45797c17868e6da9048d465090450bb91c42", "ja": "そういうことにしてあげる。心配しなくても、\n桃子はプロだから、どんな衣装も着こなせるよ。", "zh": "就当是这么回事吧。不用担心，桃子可是专业的，什么服装都能驾驭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "3e86104815dded75b379b7b631e98a93796de668cc55de5a524a59f1845dfb11", "ja": "猫耳とか、子役をやってた時に付けたことあるしね。\nCMとかテレビ番組の企画とか。", "zh": "猫耳什么的，桃子以前演童星的时候也戴过嘛。\n广告啊，电视节目的企划之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1005_p", "source_sha256": "848374cd36ed8868e2bf2be140a1c1708d6f31baec4a0344d71110f16cb771b3", "ja": "子役の時に……そ、そうか……。", "zh": "当童星的时候啊……这、这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "42e8435c57c83015e5d08b2bac5bb39379229246a1e762b818f42542f5414702", "ja": "えっ……なんでお兄ちゃんがしょんぼりしてるの？\n別に、猫耳がイヤとか言わないよ？", "zh": "咦……哥哥为什么垂头丧气的？\n我又没说讨厌猫耳啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "f069fbb119da626176aaf3b545ff9d7adc4f7f043c354e72ca38d5806b74cf2a", "ja": "前は、なんでこんなことやらされるんだろうって\n思ったこともあるけど……。", "zh": "以前也有过“为什么要被要求做这种事”的想法……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "db2e0503e0f2f72dbace62c4b958cc26b8b4c36e12d21221be01529eb3d4f9c1", "ja": "今の桃子はアイドルなんだから。ファンのみんなが\n喜んでくれるって、少しは分かってるつもりだよ。", "zh": "现在的桃子已经是偶像了。所以，我觉得自己多少也明白，粉丝们会因此感到高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f4c2a7237ef0da32bed4724b91a3e48d42788f513ffe87100bf14058b3e8bc5f", "ja": "さすがだな、桃子。\nアイドルとして立派に成長してるな！", "zh": "不愧是你，桃子。作为偶像，你成长得真出色啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "cae3095513aa26a4fb0cd6dbd354e265ff337af9152f30143d1fc2eecf93e13c", "ja": "そういうこと。桃子の心配は必要ないから、\nもっと自分のことを心配してよね。", "zh": "就是这样。所以不用担心桃子，\n多担心担心你自己吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1011_p", "source_sha256": "75dcc288ac49defe879f1f934b06ed4498bd77107051b24f20779ac4813f1a63", "ja": "自分のこと？", "zh": "我自己？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7f1686f9b81fea23e8c3d39b3b36495805b51ea22a0689299a0f66a1fadcc5c", "ja": "そうだよ。さっきみたいに目つきが悪いと、相手が\n怖がっちゃうでしょ。気をつけなきゃダメだよ。", "zh": "没错。像刚才那样眼神很凶的话，对方会害怕的吧。可得注意才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1013_p", "source_sha256": "99cfc098b5cb506f63382066ec46ca23f982d4b19721b05973263582be9695db", "ja": "そんなにだったか……。\nありがとう、桃子。注意しとくよ。", "zh": "有那么严重吗……谢谢你，桃子。我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "902e003d0696bd1ed457ac374586ccd9c2296afc9139d240b1287b4e6a582f8a", "ja": "しっかりしてね、お兄ちゃん。桃子のお仕事の成功は\nお兄ちゃんにかかってるんだから。", "zh": "要好好加油哦，哥哥。桃子工作的成功，可全都要靠哥哥了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "bacb80c9f58742d875ccab186ea5274bbeb080ce45b8fba1582165b23fe649ee", "ja": "桃子は立派なネコさんを頑張るから、\nお兄ちゃんは自分のお仕事を頑張ること！　わかった！", "zh": "桃子会努力当好一只出色的小猫，所以哥哥也要努力做好自己的工作！明白了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0573_1016_p", "source_sha256": "243b579eff1f54bb4a8307c4230c35f902847dd1ca9750306ffaf1527959038b", "ja": "（そして、猫になりきった桃子の写真は、ファンにも\n好評。桃子のプロ意識を、もっと見習わないとな！）", "zh": "（然后，完全沉浸在猫咪角色中的桃子拍的照片也受到了粉丝们的好评。我也得更加向桃子的职业精神学习才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
